===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kʷelh₁-}}
From {{uder|ru|cu|кольце}}, a diminutive from {{af|cu|коло|g1=n|t1=wheel, circle|-ьце|pos2=suffix forming diminutives of neuters|nocat=1}}, the former from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*kȍlo|t=wheel}}, whence {{m+|ru|колесо́|t=wheel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|кольцо́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-кольцо.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|кольцо́|gen_pl=коле́ц|adj=кольцево́й|dim=коле́чко}}

# [[ring]]
#: {{syn|ru|пе́рстень}}
# {{lb|ru|mathematics}} [[ring]], [[annulus]]
# [[hoop]]
# [[webring]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[roundabout]] (a road junction at which traffic streams circularly around a central island)

